Z||000005||Cheever3000||11-06-2001||02:10 PM||||I <B>do</B> appreciate your explanations for it, Cliff, and it <I>is</I> fast.  Change is difficult of some of us.  I was dragged to the Internet kicking and screaming, but look at me now.<P>Like the other guy, I knew exactly how to look up just what I wanted on the old search.  I considered a competition to see if anybody could beat me.  But I'm learning how to make this new search work for me.  Besides, it's more like other searches, and it will do me good to learn to do it this way. <BR>||||reg||1
