Z||000008||Cliff Pennock||11-06-2001||06:27 PM||||Go easy on him. He probably thought it was just part of a new version of the forum-software or something. I do wish however that people read the Announcements section more often.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>So once and for all:<P>- You <B>can</B> search on username. There's just not a seperate option for it anymore.<BR>- When used as the old search (just typing in words), the new search yields the exact same results as the old one. Just 100 times faster.<BR>- The new search has boolean operators, so you can <B>exclude</B> words from the search (couldn't be done with the old search).<BR>- The new search now gives you a short preview of the thread (the old one only showed titles).<P>The <B>only</B> thing the new search can't do (yet) that the old search could, is sort the results by date. If that makes the new search suck, well, so be it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000009||Jake_Dragon||11-06-2001||08:07 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> <P>Cliff the boolean operators work great.<BR>Give me a <B>C</B><BR>Give me a <B>L</B><P>okey you know the rest sing along with me<P>Give me a <B>I</B><BR>Give me a <B>F</B><P>Okey now just fierofreek2001<P>Give me a <B>F</B><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ok enough fun, thanks Cliff  <P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/left.gif">                    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif">                   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/right.gif">         <BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt2.GIF"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||Monkeyman||11-07-2001||02:13 AM||||Other than a slight little glitch (which Cliff fixed immediately), I think the new search engine is great.  MUCH faster than the old one.  I like the fact that you now get a preview of the thread.  Makes it easier to see if you've found the correct thread.  Way to go, Cliff!  Don't worry about the naysayers (not that you are  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ). ||||reg||1
