Z||000013||artherd||11-07-2001||04:53 AM||||Cliff, the new search ROCKS!<P>Not is it more powerful than the old one, but it's a factor of a thousand *faster* and I love the matched field text snipits (it's the google engine, correct?)<P>Very very very nice, the Fourm keeps getting better and better (I really do admire the way you've improved on it, and yet kept the essence and orgional idea intact.  Namely that you've kept it a simple and cohesive community!<P>(you might put up a quick 'for dummies who don't read the announcments, here's how to search by username' text blurb at the bottom. Just a thought)<P>Thank you again for all your hard work, we'd be lost (or at least relegated to messy and noisy email) withought you!!!!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000014||Cliff Pennock||11-07-2001||05:36 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by artherd:<BR><B>(it's the google engine, correct?)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No, it's not. I just liked the way Google highlights their words when searching through newsgroups, so I "borrowed" their color-scheme.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000015||Cliff Pennock||11-07-2001||07:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tigger:<BR><B>For example I want to find posts where "Tigger" said "pictures"</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ah, that's one thing the new search <B>can't</B> do. You can search for "Tigger" <B>and</B> "pictures", but that will return all threads were you posted, and where seomeone mentioned "pictures". You can't search through a specific user's posts alone.<P>Is that what everybody meant when they said "you can't search for usernames anymore"?<P>I can probably implement such a thing, but be aware that a search like this will be much slower than it is now.||||reg||1
