Z||000023||Cliff Pennock||11-07-2001||05:18 PM||||MM, The booleans are explained on the search page itself (if you click on "Search Help").<P>I'm closing this thread because I want all discussion & questions about the new search in one thread (easier for me to respond and to find what people want to have changed).<P>Please go <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum5/HTML/000074.html" TARGET=_blank>here</A>.||||reg||1
